and inform the course of Inuit printmaking during a period of great turmoil that threatened Inuit land,&nbsp;</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>culture</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>&nbsp;and traditional language</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>s</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>. Drawn from the Kelowna Art Gallery</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>’</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>s&nbsp;</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>p</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>ermanent&nbsp;</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>c</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>ollection and supplemented by works&nbsp;</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>on loan</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>&nbsp;</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>from Simon Fraser University</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>, Burnaby</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>, this exhibition features works on paper that&nbsp;</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>demonstrate</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>&nbsp;Pootoogook</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>’</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>s trademark style of heavy linework and well-balanced design. Blurring the b</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>oundaries</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>&nbsp;between human and animal, the spiritual and the&nbsp;</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>physical</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>, Pootoogook</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>’</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW140979673 BCX0'>s work creates space for wonder and uncertainty.</span></span><span class='EOP SCXW140979673 BCX0' data-ccp