  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/nani-vazana/event_34648_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/nani-vazana/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Nani-Vazana-live-2.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g674040"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/nani-vazana/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nani Vazana"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>NANI VAZANA</i><br /></span></strong></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Breathing new life into the ancient Spanish-Jewish language, <strong>Nani Vazana</strong> creates a bridge between the past and future with socially relevant lyrics celebrating migration, gender, and female empowerment.</span></p> <div class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>As a singer, composer, trombonist and pianist, her solo show invites the listeners into a world that is both timeless and modern. Her songs intertwine stories of Nani’s grandmother with present-day narratives, blending the sounds and smells of the marketplaces with raw flamenco-inspired vocals, soulful trombone harmonies, and heart-breaking piano. All this is topped off with electronic tracks from her laptop, creating an immersive elemental soundscape. This show is being toured in venues up to 600 capacity in Europe, USA and Canada.</span></div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'>&nbsp;</div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>With her trio, the sound world of fiery Spanish guitar and sweeping Arabic percussion, topped with her infectious stage personality and even some dance moves, Nani brings the show to bigger stages, headlining folk and jazz festivals worldwide, with up to 10,000 capacity, such as the Jazz In The Park Festival, Richmond Folk Festival, Montana Folk Festival, North Carolina Folk Festival, Lotus Festival and more.</span></p> </div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE JULY 01!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $43 | Seniors: $39 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
