    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Comedy Department: ABBA Blahblahblah"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>THE COMEDY DEPARTMENT: ABBA BLAHBLAHBLAH<br /></i>A Swedish Disco-inspired Comedy Holiday Special&nbsp;<br /></span></strong></h4> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The world’s most iconic pop group invites you into their cozy chalet for a once-in-a-lifetime holiday celebration.&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><i>ABBA-blahblahblah</i> is an improvised comedy and musical parody wrapped in gold tinsel and teetering on the edge of disaster. With heartfelt songs, holiday cheer, and just a touch of international tension, the band is determined to deliver the perfect Christmas special—no matter what.&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Will they keep it together through one more rendition of <i>Mamma Mia, Let It Snow Again</i>? Or will this end up being a big <i>SOS</i>?&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Featuring hilarious improv and music, questionable choreography and plenty of chances for the audience to sing along to the ABBA hits they (almost) remember, this show is the must see of the holiday season.&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>From the award-winning funny makers at The Comedy Department (TripAdvisor Travellers’ Choice Award winners) comes a festive spectacular where the harmonies are nearly there, but the commitment is absolute.&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Come </b><b><i>take a chance</i></b><b> on the most ridiculous holiday special you never asked for.</b>&nbsp;</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p> </div> <div> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE ARTISTS<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>The Comedy Department</b> is Vancouver’s go-to for world-class comedy and custom entertainment. With decades of experience in comedy, music, and live performance, this dynamic ensemble has delivered thousands of shows worldwide, including <i>Just for Laughs</i> and <i>Second City</i> and sharing stages with legends like Colin Mochrie and Ryan Stiles.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Their unique blend of high-energy improv, music, and clever storytelling has earned them accolades like the <b>TripAdvisor Travellers&#8217; Choice Award</b> and the <b>Consumer Choice Award for Best Comedy Club</b>. With five-star reviews, sold-out shows, and a devoted fan base, they’ve become a must-see for comedy lovers.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>And they’re not just onstage, you’ve seen them on <i>Netflix, Disney+, CW, ABC, NBC, CBS, CBC, CRAVE,</i> and <i>Amazon Prime</i>, and racking up over <b>125 million views</b> on YouTube’s <i>Convos With My 2-Year-Old</i>.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Now, The Comedy Department is taking their signature brand of sharp wit and creative performance on the road. Their hit touring shows include <b>Middle Aged Boy Band</b>-a music-fuelled parody of your favourite boy bands from the 90s and 2000s and <b>Canadian Steam</b>, a sexy, silly, and proudly Canadian comedy and music show featuring mild-mannered lumberjacks with not-so-mild dance moves. Both shows combine laugh-out-loud improv, live music, and unforgettable audience interaction that have made The Comedy Department a breakout hit on both sides of the border.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Whether you&#8217;re planning a night out in Vancouver or catching them on tour, The Comedy Department guarantees a smart, unpredictable, and wildly entertaining experience every time.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props='{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}'>&nbsp;</span></p> </div> </div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $45 | Seniors: $41 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
