  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/mike-battie/event_34685_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/mike-battie/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/kbam_mike_battie_edit-2056-scaled.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g921020"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/mike-battie/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Spring Break: Mike Battie - Juggler Extraordinare"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>MIKE BATTIE: JUGGLER EXTRAORDINAIRE<br /></i>Part of our 2026 Spring Break Programming!</span></strong></h4> <div class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Mike Battie</strong>’s hilarious physical comedy act has been delighting audiences across the continent since 1985. A master of the unicycle and a virtuoso juggler of many and varied objects, Mike boldly engages his audiences in the excitement of dazzling motion. His choreographed “William Tell Overture” is not to be missed!</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>As a young actor, Mike learned to juggle while touring extensively with children’s theatre. Since then, he has used his cir-cus skills to entertain and enchant at ex-pos, Olympics, Grey Cups, the PNE, festi-vals, and corporate events, along with appearing in dozens of commercials and roles in TV and movies.</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Mike has spent years inspiring young performers through school residencies, Circus West (formerly CirKids), festivals and fairs, and hundreds of circus camps across the country. His energizing blend of humour, physicality, and craft make Mike a performer you don’t want to miss!</span></div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE JULY 01!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults &amp; Seniors: $24 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
