        "@value": "Pump Boys &amp; Dinettes"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><em>PUMP BOYS &amp; DINETTES</em><br />Presented by First Impressions Theatre<br /></span></strong></h4> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><em><br /></em>This musical comedy is set in a gas station and diner, the “Double Cupp Diner,” on Highway 57 somewhere between Frog Level and Smyrna, and features songs celebrating the gifts of friendship, vacations, hard work, fishing and colour TV.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><em>Pump Boys &amp; Dinettes</em> is directed by Claude Giroux, with music direction by Kate MacColl and choreographed by Kailley Roessler. Featuring wacky musical numbers with genres as varied as swing, rockabilly, jazz, and country, Pump Boys and Dinettes is the catchiest musical you’ll see all year. <br /></span></p> <p class='p1'><em>Image: Kate MacColl, Matthew Simmons, Mark Anderson, Sheldon Graham, Tiffany Bishop, and Jenaya Barker. Photo by Ryan Crocker Photography.</em></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $49 | Seniors: $42 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
