      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rehearsal Hall Sessions: Rocky Horror - The Ultimate Cult Classic Screening"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>ROCKY HORROR: THE ULTIMATE CULT CLASSIC SCREENING<br /></i>Hosted by Cyd Eva</span></strong></h4> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></strong></span></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>It’s that spooky time of year again! Join us at Evergreen for a truly rocky night at the movies—</span><em style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>The Rocky Horror Picture Show</em><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>! Whether you&#8217;re a seasoned fan or a first-time viewer, this screening offers a one-of-a-kind experience complete with all the audience participation you could dream of. Hosted by long-time Rocky Horror aficionado </span><strong style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Cyd Eva</strong><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>, the evening promises an unforgettable night of costume contests (with fantastic prizes!), guidance on the iconic callbacks, and a prop goodie bag to enhance your experience.</span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>MEET YOUR HOST<br /></span></strong><span style='font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong>Cyd Eva</strong> is a queer visual artist, fashion designer, Art Teacher, podcast host, dancer, installation artist and surface pattern designer from Coquitlam so-called BC Canada. She has a BFA in visual art from Simon Fraser university, a degree in Fashion Design from Cape town college of fashion design and is a graduate of surface design immersion with bonnie christine, bravely business incubator for creative entrepreneurs and Durban university of technology’s pattern drafting program.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'>She is the founder of the brand and designs original art for pattern nation, sews and creates many of our products and is the inventor of our blobs: interactive play sculptures. She is passionate about creativity, community, self expression, colour and pattern and deeply values the time she has spent in Canada, South Africa and England building the Pattern Nation brand through events, collaborations and teaching. Cyd is currently teaching visual art and fashion design at<a style='color: #000000;' href='https://placedesarts.ca/'> Place Des Arts</a> and the Evergreen Cultural Centre in Coquitlam and offers programs for youth and adults.&nbsp;</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults &amp; Seniors: $25 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
