        "@id": "_:g1241600"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/pour-decisions-spring-2026/var/ri-3.l-L1"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pour Decisions Art Night"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 14pt;'>POUR DECISIONS ART NIGHT<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Educator Cyd Eva</span></b></span></span></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Unwind, sip, and get inspired at Creative Sips—a relaxed, social art night where creativity meets connection. Enjoy a glass of wine while exploring new artistic skills in a fun, welcoming studio setting.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Each session features a different craft—painting, printmaking, sewing, and more—led by talented local instructors who make it easy for anyone to dive in. Whether you’re a beginner or a seasoned maker, you’ll leave with something beautiful (and made by you!).</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>It’s the perfect date night, friends’ night out, or creative solo escape. All materials are provided—just bring your curiosity and someone to share the fun with.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Come for the wine, stay for the art</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><br /></span></p> <p class='p1'><strong style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;</p> <p></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>6 Sessions to Choose From! |&nbsp; 6:30 &#8211; 9:30PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$55/person per session<br />Age 18+<br /></span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><br />ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Cyd Eva is a queer visual artist, fashion designer, face painter, teacher, dancer, and installation artist based in Coquitlam, BC. She holds a BFA in Visual Art from Simon Fraser University, a Fashion Design degree from Cape Town College of Fashion Design, and has trained in surface pattern design, creative entrepreneurship, and pattern drafting.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
