entaries, Corporate Presentations, E-Learning, Social Media Ads and On Hold Messaging. In addition to voice acting, she has also produced spots with a few co-writing credits.<br /></span></h4> <h4><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM<br /></strong><strong><br /></strong></span></h4> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
