      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AWOL"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>AWOL<br /></i>Presented by RibbitRePublic Theatre<br />Written by Rob Gee</span></strong></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Two old men escape from a care home and go to a metal festival. Cyril doesn’t like old people, which is a shame because he is one. When he learns his estranged granddaughter, Lily, has her big break with her thrash metal band, Abscess, he and his friend Neville are determined to show up and support her. Neither of them will ever be the same again. AWOL is a buddy adventure caper about two men who decide they’ve had enough of bland food, dull company and care home radio.</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $49 | Seniors: $42 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
