  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/variety-series/event_34664_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/ballet-victoria-the-nutcracker-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-4.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g1977700"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/variety-series/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ballet Victoria: The Gift of The Nutcracker"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>THE GIFT OF THE NUTCRACKER<br /></i>Ballet Victoria</span></strong></h4> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Ballet Victoria</strong>’s <em>The Gift of The Nutcracker</em> is a 21st century updated family tradition with everything you expect from a ballet production. An original Christmas tale danced to the timeless score of the Nutcracker with humorous pantomime, beautiful costumes, magic and as always, surprises for the whole family. The score drives the imaginative choreography for the company dancers. We invite you come and enjoy the timeless tale guaranteed to warm your heart and spread holiday cheer. Watch the story come alive and enthral the whole family!</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The Nutcracker is a Christmas classic that the whole family can enjoy. The Nutcracker dates back to 1892 at the Mariinksy theatre in Saint Petersburg. Originally choreographed by Marius Petipa and Lev Ivanov, with Pyotr Ilyich Tchaikovsky’s Nutcracker score, it has become a world-renowned holiday classic. The traditional ballet takes a trip to the ‘Land of Sweets’ where each sweet is represented by a different country around the world. The Nutcracker is still being performed seasonally by many ballet companies and continues to adapt to the modern world.</span></p> </div> </div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE JULY 01!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $45 | Seniors: $41 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
