    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "UNIQUE REPERTOIRES. WORLD CLASS MUSICIANS.We are delighted to welcome internationally acclaimed and celebrated pianists Elithabeth and Marcel Bergmann - The Bergmann Duo - for a special, afternoon series of salon-style concerts. Each show begins with a pre-show reception, complete with complimentary tea, coffee, in our lake-side lobby. Have questions"
