  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/kids-upcycled-fashion/event_35439_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/kids-upcycled-fashion/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/1744935869976.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g2276540"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/kids-upcycled-fashion/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Reimagine &amp; Reinvent: Upcycled Fashion for Kids"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>REIMAGINE &amp; REINVENT: UPCYCLED FASHION FOR KIDS<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Educator Cyd Eva</span></b></span></span></h4> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Step into the world of sustainable style with this hands-on, artist-led workshop where pre-loved clothing becomes one-of-a-kind wearable art! Guided by a professional designer, you’ll learn how to transform old garments into bold, personalized pieces while exploring the foundations of eco-conscious fashion.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Get hands-on with a variety of techniques—basic sewing, hand stitching, embroidery, fabric painting, embellishing, and more—and bring your fashion ideas to life. Whether you’re a sewing newbie or a budding fashionista looking to level up your skills, you’ll receive guidance and inspiration every step of the way.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>We’ll provide a curated selection of second-hand clothing, and you’re encouraged to bring a few items of your own to reinvent. With two sewing machines, a serger, and the option to bring your own machine, there’s plenty of room to experiment, play, and create.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Perfect for anyone passionate about personal style, creative reuse, and sustainable design. Walk out with fashion that’s uniquely you—and a fresh set of skills to keep the creativity flowing!</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION | 2 Sessions Available!</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tuesday Evenings, January 20 &#8211; March 10 | 4 &#8211; 6PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$215/person<br />Age 9 &#8211; 16<br /></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tuesday Evenings, April 7 &#8211; May 26 | 4 &#8211; 6PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$215/person<br />Age 9 &#8211; 16</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><br />ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Cyd Eva is a queer visual artist, fashion designer, face painter, teacher, dancer, and installation artist based in Coquitlam, BC. She holds a BFA in Visual Art from Simon Fraser University, a Fashion Design degree from Cape Town College of Fashion Design, and has trained in surface pattern design, creative entrepreneurship, and pattern drafting.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
