        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>SECRETS OF MAGIC: BECOME A MAGICIAN&#8217;S APPRENTICE!<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Educator Michael Charrois</span></b></span></span></h4> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Step behind the curtain and discover the secrets of the magic world! In this hands-on workshop, young magicians will learn how to perform amazing tricks using simple magic gimmicks — but shh&#8230; you’ll be sworn to secrecy!</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>You’ll learn not just what to do, but how to do it, the real magic is in the performance! Practice your patter (the words magicians use to build excitement), master the Rule of Threes, and pick up presentation tips that will make your tricks truly unforgettable.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>By the end of the session, you’ll have a 10–15 minute magic show ready to wow your friends and family, and maybe even take on the road!</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Get ready to amaze, entertain, and unlock the magic within you.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION | 2 Sessions Available!</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Wednesday Evenings, February 4 &#8211; 18 | 4:30 &#8211; 6:30PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$55/person<br />Age 9 &#8211; 16<br /></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Wednesday Evenings, April 15 &#8211; 29 | 4:30 &#8211; 6:30PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$55/person<br />Age 9 &#8211; 16</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><br />ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR<br /></strong></span></p> <p class='p1'><span class='s1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Michael Charrois is a professional actor (UBCP/Actra and Equity) with over 30 years of teaching experience. He currently teaches Drama classes for the Evergreen, Burnaby&#8217;s Shadbolt Centre Community Programs and has taught Continuing Education classes for the Vancouver School Board</span></p> <p></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
