  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/bunheads-holiday-gala-2025/event_35375_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/bunheads-holiday-gala-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Bunheads-Gala.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g2482600"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/organizer": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g2482640"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/bunheads-holiday-gala-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Bunheads Holiday Gala"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>ABOUT BUNHEADS BALLET</strong><br /></span></span>Founded in 2018, Bunheads began with three dancers in a room above a small cafe in the West End of Vancouver. Little did we know that a few years later there&#8217;d be a community of adult ballerinas performing full-length productions such as <em>The Nutcracker</em> and <em>Swan Lake</em>! Our mission is to spread the joy of ballet. We truly believe it is for everyone, regardless of our experience, age, or body type. There is never a wrong time to begin dancing. No matter whether you can join us in person or virtually in our online studio, we are committed to helping you achieve your dance dreams.</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE:</strong><br />All tickets just $36!<br /></span></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Bunheads Ballet.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
