    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "You used to call me Marie..."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>YOU USED TO CALL ME MARIE&#8230;<br /></i></span></strong><strong><span style='color: #000000;'>An Arts Club Theatre Company Presentation<br /></span></strong><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i></i>By Tai Amy Grauman<br />A Savage Society &amp; NAC Indigenous Theatre Production<br /></span></strong></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Music plays and ponies dance as the epic story of Marie Callihoo and generations of Alberta’s Métis women unfurls through time. Follow Marie, Iskwewo, Napew, and Mistatim (“horse” in Michif) in intertwined celebrations of love and resilience as the Métis Nation emerges across the plains.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Robust in scope yet intimate, <i>You used to call me Marie</i>… explores the fur trade and political uprisings in the 1930s to the present through era-spanning dance and live music, from French fiddle to contemporary country..</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='font-size: 10pt; color: #808080;'>Image: Aren Okemaysim and Tai Amy Grauman. Photo by Ben Laird.</span></p> <p></span></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $54 | Seniors: $46 | Students: $16 | Row A: $29</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
