    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2025/2026 THEATRE SERIES SUBSCRIPTIONS JOIN US FOR A THRILLING SEASON OF THEATRE!As we prepare for our full 2025/2026 season of events, secure your seats early and save 20% with a full Theatre Series subscription! Enjoy an exciting series of eight productions from local theatre companies, including the Arts Club"
