        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "LIFE DRAWING ARTIST SESSIONSObserving real-life models and practicing different poses will help enhance your understanding of proportions and anatomy. We provide studio space, easels, and models for each session. Ages 18+. $15/person, pay-more-if-you-can. Pre-registration encouraged. ARTS EDUCATION AT EVERGREEN LIFE DRAWING CODE OF CONDUCT Our interactions and conduct towards"
